WEBVTT

00:00:00.269 --> 00:00:03.256
Apply PAUSE to the whole fictional reminder project:

00:00:03.593 --> 00:00:09.297
purpose, affected people, uncertainty, safeguards and escalation. The

00:00:09.342 --> 00:00:12.710
purpose is clear information. A participant and coordinator

00:00:12.935 --> 00:00:15.883
may rely on an incorrect reception claim. Independent

00:00:15.928 --> 00:00:18.982
confirmation is missing. Remove the claim, retain the

00:00:19.027 --> 00:00:23.428
hold and require human review. Route unresolved status

00:00:23.654 --> 00:00:26.395
to the training owner. Choose a proportionate action:

00:00:26.732 --> 00:00:29.876
retain the checked simulated draft with safeguards and

00:00:29.921 --> 00:00:33.603
pause reliance on reception. Explain what continues, what

00:00:33.648 --> 00:00:36.460
stops and what evidence would change the decision.
